{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tree: a connected, acyclic undirected graph with at least one vertex, so it has exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"n − 1 edges, no self-loop and no parallel edges. The invariant is the type: every initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from unchecked input is failable, and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tree"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot be mutated."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/init(_:)-9sges","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/init(_:)-p96","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/init(edges:)","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/init(pruferSequence:)","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/init(vertices:edges:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/pruferSequence"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/path(from:to:)"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/CustomDebugStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Decodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Encodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Graph-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Graph-Implementations","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/Tree\/Hashable-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kin